$ jailops list
! No jails in project main. Create one with: jailops jail create NAME --image IMAGE --network NETWORK --storage STORAGE

$ jailops network list
! No networks. Create one with: jailops network create NAME --ipv4 10.50.0.1/24 --uplink IFACE --nat

$ jailops image list
! No images. Create one with: jailops image create freebsd-15-1 --release 15.1-RELEASE, then jailops image build freebsd-15-1

$ jailops list web*
! No jails in project main match.

$ jailops storage show fast
